{
  "id": "func-two-lines-intersection",
  "prompt": "在同一坐标系中用 f(x) = 2x + 1 和 g(x) = -x + 4 的形式定义两条直线，只标注它们的交点 P，不要创建其他点",
  "category": "functions",
  "notes": "交点 (1,3); P 绑定第一个 point, 若 agent 先画轴上辅助点会误绑——用户审核重点",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "kind": "object_exists",
      "type": "function",
      "min": 2
    },
    {
      "kind": "object_exists",
      "type": "point"
    },
    {
      "kind": "measure_eq",
      "select": {
        "P": {
          "type": "point"
        }
      },
      "expr": "x(%P%)",
      "expect": 1,
      "tol": 0.01
    },
    {
      "kind": "measure_eq",
      "select": {
        "P": {
          "type": "point"
        }
      },
      "expr": "y(%P%)",
      "expect": 3,
      "tol": 0.01
    }
  ]
}
